Server Rules

1. Be respectful.
Debate ideas — don’t attack people. No harassment, slurs, or intimidation.

2. Add signal.
Share context, sources, or informed perspective. Low-effort trolling and spam will be removed.

3. Stay on topic.
Posts should relate to war, geopolitics, and the core focus of this community.

4. No self-promotion without participation.
Relevant work is welcome when you are actively part of the conversation.

5. Protect safety and privacy.
Do not share personal data, dox, or post information that could put anyone at risk.
